description=CleanUI provides a cleaner, compact, and configurable inventory and loot interface for Project Zomboid Build 42. <LINE> Features include configurable container bars, persistent drag-and-drop container ordering, search and transfer shortcuts, sorting and column controls, optional weight display, collapsible item groups, and client-side layout and visual settings. <LINE> Requires NeatUI Framework. This package is used for Project Zomboid Build 42.13.x.
